  "statement": "Two strings are anagrams when one can be rearranged into the other: they use exactly the same letters, each the same number of times. Given strings `s` and `t`, return `True` if they are anagrams of each other and `False` otherwise.\n\nConstraints: 1 <= len(s), len(t) <= 5 * 10^4; both strings contain only lowercase English letters.",
